Using Population Variance ~ 49.289;<p>SalesPerPixel(Sample) ~ .275<p>This doesn't seem right, where does the math screw up?<p>That said, this isn't very useful. The only time someone will show sales graphs is for special events... aka when it DOESN'T follow a possion distribution.
